  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\nWe have,\n\n (2a-5)/(a)-(4b-5)/(b)+(6c+5)/(c)=0\n\n⇒ 2 - (5)/(a) - 4 + (5)/(b) + 6 + (5)/(c) = 0\n\n⇒ 8 - 4 = (5)/(a) - (5)/(b) - (5)/(c)\n\n⇒ 4 = 5 [(1)/(a) - (1)/(b) - (1)/(c) ]\n\n⇒ [(1)/(a) - (1)/(b) - (1)/(c) ] = 4/5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (1).**",
